    "format_scope": "Four genuine manual young heroes at 20 health: Dori, Maxx, Dori, Dori. A real owned prior Copper Cog5 starts in P2 Arena with zero steam, a valid state after its last counter was removed at a previous upkeep; that past procedure is not claimed tested. Actual empty P1 turn ends and P2 turn3 begins. The printed own-Start upkeep cannot remove a steam counter, so it must destroy the physical non-token Item. Native own-Start dispatch moves UID5 to its owner2 Graveyard, with no optional payment waived, no other simultaneous Start/destruction observers, no new card or RNG use, and Action begins with P2 AP1. Normal Hand entry, Crank and Cog attacks remain held under207/211; no repair or closure is claimed. No seeded future effect or engine change.",
